INTRODUCTION 

this  is  a programme   written  in  go   used to keep   track  of  changes in  files and   autobackup   whenever some changes  happen  in  a given   file  
It  also  keeps  track  record  any changes   on files  logs 
Can  handle  Create/Update/Delete  files  in   subfolder   

Have  two  files  
 1 Ensure Go interpreter  is installed 
 2 We  heve  two  folders 1  Server (runs the server   for the  files storage) and Clientx  (where  the files will be  monitored in the client  Pc )
 3 Run   server/go run . (In  the  server end) 
 4 Take the Clientx  folder and copy  it to the  client(s) who  need their  files  tracked  then  go to Clientx  folder and run (go run .)
 5 Enter  the  IPADDRESS:P0RT NUMBER port number  is 8080 
 6 so  the Root folder where the  files need to be tracked is called storage inside the Clientx  This is  where all the files   that need be tracked 
 
   